1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,200
Today, I cook. Someone else can clean up.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:09,000
Cooked chickpeas, cucumber, tomato, lemon juice, and olive oil.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,800
Rinse canned chickpeas, then drain them well.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,300
Wash the cucumber and tomato, then dice them.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,300
Tip the chickpeas and vegetables into a bowl.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,300
One teaspoon each of lemon juice and olive oil. Gently toss.

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:31,500
Beans and vegetables fit a liver-friendly eating pattern.

8
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:35,633
No magic liver detox. Just a tasty everyday habit.

9
00:00:35,833 --> 00:00:39,233
The dishes, too? Heart can handle those.

